{"title":"Biology forums","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Biology forums</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Online_forum&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Online forum (page does not exist)\"> online forums</a> that are great places to ask questions about <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology\" title=\"Biology\">biology</a>, practice teaching biological concepts, and to socialize with other biology students.  Here are a few popular online biology forums.  \n</p>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/index.php?f=329\">Biology Forum</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.biology-online.org/biology-forum/\">Biology-Online Forums</a> are quite active.</li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_forums&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_websites&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Biology websites (page does not exist)\">Biology websites</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_scholarships\" title=\"Biology scholarships\">Biology scholarships</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Biology_competitions\" title=\"Biology competitions\">Biology competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academics_forums\" title=\"Academics forums\">Academics forums</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Social_software&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Social software (page does not exist)\">Social software</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit 